WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.390
Three palaces: one for the
cold season, one for the hot,

2
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.340
one for the rains.

3
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.710
Buddhists tell of a prince
raised there, with music,

4
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.600
fine clothes and the best food.

5
00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.740
Wise men said the baby would
be a great world ruler,

6
00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.420
or a Buddha.

7
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.690
His father wanted a king.

8
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.710
So he hid every sign of suffering.

9
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.440
At 29, the prince went out on four trips.

10
00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.950
Why would four ordinary sights
make him walk away from everything?

11
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.600
In this mission, you'll trace his story
from before his birth to the palace.

12
00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:39.180
Then you'll meet the
four sights, one by one.

13
00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:44.750
Your mission: find out why four ordinary
sights made a prince give up everything.
